{
  "slug": "tofu-veggie-scramble",
  "name": "Tofu veggie scramble",
  "description": "Crumbled firm tofu browned in a skillet with onion, red bell pepper and wilted spinach for a savory plant-based start to the morning.",
  "iconKey": "crosshair",
  "instructions": [
    "Press the tofu to draw off excess moisture, then crumble it into rough, bite-sized pieces.",
    "Warm the oil in a wide skillet over medium heat, add the onion and bell pepper, and cook until they soften, about 4 minutes.",
    "Add the crumbled tofu and the ground cumin, then cook undisturbed for 3 minutes so the edges brown.",
    "Fold in the spinach and cook just until it wilts, about 2 minutes.",
    "Divide between two warm plates and serve right away."
  ],
